    {
      "subName": "",
      "name": "Semi-universal Tune Kit",
      "description": "Used for modifying and tuning vehicle handling\nMust remain on vehicle to function. Install in place of a controller seat, then place your preferred seat onto this one.\nHowever, modifications are saved to this part, and will resume when this part is replaced!\n\nMake the best of your vehicle with IVLabs!",
